## 2. API Endpoints Contract

All secured endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <JWT>` header.

### 2.1 Authentication & Profile Endpoints

#### A. Admin / Expert Login
- **URL:** `POST /api/v1/auth/login`
- **Access:** Public
- **Request Body:**
  ```json
  {
    "username": "expert_software@nasrplus.ir",
    "password": "SecurePassword@123"
  }
  ```
- **Response (`200 OK`):**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Login successful",
    "data": {
      "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6...",
      "admin": {
        "id": "672b1234567890abcdef1001",
        "username": "expert_software@nasrplus.ir",
        "type": "EXPERT",
        "fullName": "مهندس رضایی (کارشناس نرم‌افزار)",
        "permissions": [],
        "reviewableSpecializations": [
          {
            "_id": "672a9876543210fedcba2001",
            "title": "نرم‌افزار",
            "code": "SW",
            "isActive": true
          },
          {
            "_id": "672a9876543210fedcba2004",
            "title": "امنیت فضای تبادل اطلاعات (افتا)",
            "code": "SEC",
            "isActive": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
  ```

#### B. Authenticated Profile Details (`/me`)
- **URL:** `GET /api/v1/auth/me`
- **Access:** Authenticated (any valid admin/expert token)
- **Response (`200 OK`):**
  Returns the complete admin object with `permissions` and `reviewableSpecializations` populated.

#### C. Authenticated Admin's Own Login History
- **URL:** `GET /api/v1/auth/my-login-logs`
- **Access:** Authenticated
- **Query Parameters:**
  - `page`: (number, default: 1)
  - `limit`: (number, default: 10)
- **Response (`200 OK`):**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Login history retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "logs": [
        {
          "_id": "672b5555567890abcdef3001",
